subtitle: The historical choice. The motion passes 284 to 12. SPD relations fall, the Left approves. · dev: spd_relation −3, kf_left_dissent −2, workers_kpd +1×m
on-arrival: spd_relation -= 3; kf_left_dissent -= 2; workers_kpd += 1*campaign_mult
go-to: root

The House backs the chancellor by 284 votes to 12. Our deputies vote no and say why: the passive resistance is paid for with the workers' wages and the mark, while the coal barons are compensated and keep their profits abroad. The bourgeois press calls us the party of the foreigner. In the Ruhr the miners listen, for now, to the nation.

